 "remarks": "Exquisitely located at the end of the bucolic North Stamford neighborhood, This home is a classic colonial - over 6,100 square feet with large rooms, featuring 4 bedrooms with a 5th main level bedroom/office, 4 full baths, 3 half baths, on over 2 manicured acres. This home is of the highest quality craftsmanship and it features many standout features such as high ceilings, custom moldings, a soaring two-story foyer, private master bedroom balcony, oversized upstairs family room/rec room/play room, tons of storage, basement wine cellar, fenced yard, 3 car oversized garage, ample driveway with basketball hoop. Enjoy indoor/outdoor living with multiple French doors leading to the expansive bluestone back patio featuring a pergola, garden and partially covered area. There are 3 fireplaces, a Chefs kitchen with high quality appliances and a wet bar with sink and wine fridge. This home is just 8 minutes from the Merritt Parkway and is close to Greenwich, Bedford, Pound Ridge, downtown Stamford, schools etc. Furnishing options available (partial or unfurnished) Pets to be considered by landlord.",
